(7769952, 1289849, 30214, '<td valign="top">
Lovely portrait with very genuine smile. It could''ve easily been a ribbon but what brought the score down a bit, I think, is that her heir is completely submerged in the black background, not a hint of separation. Just a little bit of light on the background or a rim light on her hair (for example, something white on the left reflecting the light back on her) would''ve made a big difference</td>', 'Lovely portrait with very genuine smile. It could''ve easily been a ribbon but what brought the score down a bit, I think, is that her heir is completely submerged in the black background, not a hint of separation. Just a little bit of light on the background or a rim light on her hair (for example, something white on the left reflecting the light back on her) would''ve made a big difference', '2024-09-12 18:40:43.000000', NULL, 0);
